{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">開學日，大角咀有乘坐私家車上學的中學生在下車時被車胎輾傷腳，送院治理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事的14歲男中學生輕傷，由救護車送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.TKT-0900.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Gh3vuJXkNh1788224827.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.TKT-0900.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場消息指早上七時許，該中學生乘坐私家車至詩歌舞街落車，打算步行返學時，期間被車胎輾傷，事故原因有待調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T02:40:12.780204+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}